		"QG_RESOURCES_T": "Resources",
		"QG_RESOURCES_B": "Gold and wood from the start. Steel comes with your first Foundry (era 2) and oil with your first Refinery (era 3). Everything goes into one shared storehouse: what does not fit is lost, and each Warehouse adds 500. Your people eat 1 food per cycle: the Farm grows it and you collect it with a tap.\n\nMaterials: planks, ingots, beams and fuel. Specialised buildings make them and advanced buildings need them. They are kept apart, in the workshop.",
