		"LBL_TECH_INTRO": "Research PERMANENT advantages here. Each one costs resources and time, and only one is researched at a time. Three branches (Industrial, Military, Transport) of five tiers, in order: tier 2 needs tier 1.\nIn the world: the Regency gave us up for lost and took the blueprints with it. This is what the Forgotten invent again on their own.",
