		"TUT_PLAY_1_BODY_TOUCH": "The Core is your centre. It cannot be demolished and it never falls.\n\nFirst, always: a sawmill. Without wood there is nothing, and everything that follows costs it. Place it right next to a forest: extractors go beside their deposit, just as the gold mine goes beside a vein.\n\nThen a house. Almost every building needs people to run it; without workers it stands idle.\n\nBUILD button at the bottom. Drag a finger to move the camera, pinch to zoom, and ↻ to rotate before placing.",
