		"PRO_1_TITLE": "The Emperor's signature",
		"PRO_1_BODY": "The Empire controls almost the whole world. Every order it gives carries the Emperor's signature.\n\nNo one has seen him in a hundred years. He has been dead for a century. The Regency rules in his name and signs for him. A dead emperor never changes his mind or forgives a debt.",
		"PRO_1_NOTE": "We have spent our whole lives obeying a dead man.",
		"PRO_1_STAMP": "SIGNED",
		"PRO_2_TITLE": "The Storm",
		"PRO_2_BODY": "Every so often, the sky fills with ash. That is the Storm. The Empire sends it to break what we build.\n\nBehind the ash come the Collectors. They count what is in the storehouses and take their share. They call it the Tax. First comes the ruin, then the bill.",
		"PRO_2_NOTE": "The Storm is not weather: it is mail, and it always arrives on time.",
		"PRO_3_TITLE": "Who we are",
		"PRO_3_BODY": "We are the Forgotten. It is the Empire's name for what it gives up for lost. Three generations ago, it gave up this island. Those who could pay for a ship left. We stayed.\n\nNow smoke rises from our chimneys, and the Empire is looking again. We will build and survive every Storm. We will not pay the Tax. And when they come down to collect, we will beat them.",
		"PRO_3_NOTE": "“On the mud of history, we shall build monuments of steel.”",
		"PRO_3_STAMP": "ALIVE",
		"PRO_4_TITLE": "From nothing",
		"PRO_4_BODY": "We start with almost nothing: a Core, a few trees and our own hands. We will build everything from scratch.\n\nFirst we grow our economy. With it we train soldiers. And with soldiers we fight the Empire, so no one ever oppresses us again.",
		"PRO_4_NOTE": "Brick by brick, until they stop giving us orders.",
		"PRO_B_TITLE": "Pending",
		"PRO_B_BODY": "Report from the coast watch: smoke where the books say nobody lives.\n\nWhile it is decided what to do, the island is left off the route. No ash and no Collectors will be sent.\n\nLet them build. There will be more to collect later.",
		"PRO_B_NOTE": "The Storm does not reach us here. Build.",
		"PRO_B_STAMP": "PENDING",
		"LBL_GUIDE_STEP": "TUTORIAL  ·  STEP %d OF %d",
		"LBL_GUIDE_DONE_BADGE": "TUTORIAL  ·  DONE",
		"BTN_GUIDE_END_REPLAY": "End replay",
		"GUIDE_NEED_WORKERS": "Not enough workers: %d more.",
		"BTN_GUIDE_OK": "Got it",
		"BTN_GUIDE_REPLAY": "Replay tutorial",
		"GUIDE_OPEN_BUILD": "First, wood: almost everything is built with it. Click BUILD, at the bottom.",
		"GUIDE_OPEN_BUILD_TOUCH": "First, wood: almost everything is built with it. Tap BUILD, at the bottom.",
		"GUIDE_PICK_SAWMILL": "Choose the Sawmill and press BUILD. It cuts wood from the forest.",
		"GUIDE_PICK_SAWMILL_TOUCH": "Tap the Sawmill, then BUILD. It cuts wood from the forest.",
		"GUIDE_PLACE_SAWMILL": "Click next to a forest: the Sawmill has to touch it. The road to the Core builds itself (1 gold per tile).",
		"GUIDE_PLACE_SAWMILL_TOUCH": "Tap a green square next to the forest, then ✓ BUILD HERE. The road to the Core builds itself (1 gold per tile).",
		"GUIDE_WAIT_SAWMILL": "Look at the road: it comes on its own from the Core. Your workers walk along it: without a road, a building does not work.",
		"GUIDE_OPEN_HOUSE": "The House: your people live here. Each one brings 6 more workers. Click BUILD.",
		"GUIDE_OPEN_HOUSE_TOUCH": "The House: your people live here. Each one brings 6 more workers. Tap BUILD.",
		"GUIDE_PICK_HOUSE": "Choose the House and press BUILD.",
		"GUIDE_PICK_HOUSE_TOUCH": "Tap the House, then BUILD.",
		"GUIDE_PRESS_BUILD": "Good. Now press BUILD, bottom right.",
		"GUIDE_PRESS_BUILD_TOUCH": "Good. Now tap BUILD, bottom right.",
		"GUIDE_PLACE_HOUSE": "Click a free spot, ideally next to the road: the closer, the less road you pay.",
		"GUIDE_PLACE_HOUSE_TOUCH": "Tap a free spot, ideally next to the road: the closer, the less road you pay.",
		"GUIDE_DONE": "You know the basics! Your goal stays the same: 3 eras, the Headquarters at level 3 and surviving the Final Assault. That is how the Storm stops for good.\nWHAT TO DO? (in ☰ MENU) always tells you the next step.",
		"GUIDE_MOVE_CAMERA": "None in sight: move the camera towards the arrow (WASD or drag).",
		"GUIDE_MOVE_CAMERA_TOUCH": "None in sight: drag the map towards the arrow.",
		"BTN_HELP_CLOSE": "Close this help",
